<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9418] Avoid initialize file page store manager for caches during PME synchronously</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9418</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently, we do creation for partition and index files during PME for starting caches at the beginning of org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.cache.persistence.GridCacheDatabaseSharedManager#readCheckpointAndRestoreMemory method.&lt;br/&gt;
We should avoid this because sometimes it took a long time as we perform writing to disk.&lt;br/&gt;
 If the cache was registered during PME we should initialize page store lazy or asynchronously.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13181896">IGNITE-9418</key>
            <summary>Avoid initialize file page store manager for caches during PME synchronously</summary>
